## Third-party Licenses

This project bundles references from [0xsline/short-drama](https://github.com/0xsline/short-drama)
(MIT License) under `data/knowledge/references/`. See `LICENSE-short-drama.txt` for details.

Architecture ideas inspired by:
- [XiangTodayEatsWhat/ShakeDrama](https://github.com/XiangTodayEatsWhat/ShakeDrama) (Apache 2.0)
- COMIC paper (arXiv:2603.11048) - academic research

Reuses modules from [obsidian-novel-publisher](https://github.com/blackclaw0318/obsidian-novel-publisher):
- `src/github_backup.py` (pattern)
- `src/wechat_notifier.py` (pattern)
- `src/backup_reader.py` (pattern)